00:00:20.319 --> 00:00:23.589 line:0%
I sent out
a #AddAWordRuinATVShow.

00:00:23.589 --> 00:00:25.858 line:0%
I asked you guys
to take the title of a TV show,

00:00:25.858 --> 00:00:27.360 line:0%
add one word,
change the meaning.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.128 line:0%
Within minutes,
it was a trending topic.

00:00:29.128 --> 00:00:30.730 line:0%
So thank you for playing along.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.032 line:0%
We love that. We love
when you play along. Thank you.

